1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,400
Running ten Claude Code terminals at once?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,800
Ten terminals. One of you. Approving everything.

3
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,600
What if you just... said it?

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,900
Say it into your phone, whenever it hits.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Tag it, and it's a ticket.

6
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:20,000
One loop checks in every ten minutes, and ships them, one by one.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,900
You only hear back when it's done.

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,000
Stop babysitting terminals.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,500
Become the orchestrator.

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,200
Loop engineering, with Contextli.
